ices such as HTTP, RDP, SSH and SMB.\nThe free TryCloudflare Quick Tunnel will generate a random subdomain on trycloudflare[.]com, following a call to api[.]trycloudflare[.]com.\nThe tool has been observed in ", "Computers": [], "Criticality": 6, "EventIDs": [1], "Schema": "1.0.0"}, "Name": "Sigma: Cloudflared Quick Tunnel Execution", "Tags": ["Sigma", "SigmaHQ", "T1090.001"]}
